              "alt": "The suffix array of the string banana$, after the book's box in section 11.1. The left column lists all seven suffixes by starting position, from banana$ at position 0 to $ at position 6. The right column lists the same suffixes in alphabetical order, giving the suffix array 6, 5, 3, 1, 0, 4, 2. The two suffixes that begin with \"ana\", at positions 3 and 1, are highlighted next to each other in the sorted list.",
